{"timestamp":"2026-08-27T00:08:00Z","title":"Mixed predicate evaluation units are not a monotonic benchmark axis","summary":"A single 0..=8 Suspended-head benchmark axis changed physical predicate composition at unit five: current predicates decreased while frozen Opening predicates increased. RefTime peaked near the composition boundary and then fell, causing generated linear regression to discard the axis and underprice realizable intermediate branches.","scope":"actors-production-weight","status":"resolved","files":"template/pallets/actors/src/benchmarking.rs,template/runtime/src/weights/pallet_deos_actors.rs","tags":"benchmark-axis,non-monotonic,opening-predicate,weight-soundness","remedy":"Keep the monotonic current-only 0..=4 owner and benchmark Opening-heavy branches under a separate direct owner materializing the worst realizable one-Opening/three-current composition; do not encode changing physical compositions as one linear parameter.","related":"I4 Control Weight Port"}
