{"timestamp":"2026-08-27T06:41:19Z","title":"Whole-pipeline control liveness does not require prepaying future Action effects","summary":"The first EXP-0019 correction combined Actor control and Task-effect maxima into one retry-inclusive Cycle balance reserve. That conflated deterministic machine service with uncertain transaction-like Actions, created a persistent run fee ledger, and charged authority for effects that might never be invoked.","scope":"actors-fee-lifecycle","status":"resolved","files":"template/pallets/actors/docs/specification.en.md,.agents/skills/architecture-experiments/tracks/actors/EXP-0019.md","tags":"fee-boundary,pipeline-machine,action-effect,run-ledger","remedy":"Charge Trigger plus complete bounded Pipeline Machine control upfront at ready Opening, charge each invoked Action from current valid-actual effect evidence, treat unfunded non-invocation as FundingUnavailable, and retain no run machine balance ledger.","related":"actors/EXP-0019"}
